# Backend Startup Procedure

## Always Kill Port 8080 First
```bash
lsof -ti:8080 | xargs kill -9 2>/dev/null || echo "No process on port 8080"
```

## Start Backend
```bash
cd back-end
mvn spring-boot:run -q -Dmaven.test.skip=true -Dspring-boot.run.arguments="--server.port=8080" > /dev/null 2>&1 &
```

## Verify Startup
```bash
sleep 15
curl -s http://localhost:8080/actuator/health | grep -q '"status":"UP"' && echo "✅ Backend running" || echo "❌ Backend failed"
```

## Check Logs
```bash
cd back-end && tail -5 logs/timebeam.log | grep -E "(APNs|started|initialized)"
```

